  GrammarLesson('g_pronouns', 'A0', 'Pronouns (सर्वनाम)', 'Pronoun (सर्वनाम) noun की जगह इस्तेमाल होता है ताकि नाम बार-बार न दोहराना पड़े: I (मैं), you (तुम/आप), he (वह, लड़का), she (वह, लड़की), it (यह), we (हम), they (वे)।', 'A pronoun is a word that takes the place of a noun.', 'Subject: I, you, he, she, it, we, they.\nObject: me, you, him, her, it, us, them.\nPossessive: my, your, his, her, its, our, their.',
